OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest over
OL,4,Asuspected shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 51-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after
OL,8,Farmed police were called to a suspected
OL,9,Ffirearm discharge in Ilkeston.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police said a 27-year-old
OL,12,Fman was taken to hospital with injuries
OL,13,Fthat are not thought to be
OL,14,Flife-threatening after an "altercation"
OL,15,Fin Taylor Street at 21:30 GMT on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,18,FThe 51-year-old was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of attempted murder, affray
OL,20,Fand possession of a firearm with intent
OL,21,Fto endanger life. He remains in police
OL,22,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
